  "notes": "{示|しめ}す means to show, indicate, or demonstrate something.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- Takes を particle for the object shown\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- X⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{示|しめ}す: to show/indicate X\n- X⟦で→で：00502_de⟧{示|しめ}す: to show by means of X\n- X⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{示|しめ}す: to show to X (person)\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ⟦{方向|ほうこう}→方向：03617_houkou⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{示|しめ}す: to indicate direction\n- ⟦{例|れい}→例：09932_rei⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{示|しめ}す: to give an example\n- ⟦{態度|たいど}→態度：03396_taido⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{示|しめ}す: to show one's attitude\n- ⟦{興味|きょうみ}→興味：01316_kyoumi⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{示|しめ}す: to show interest\n- ⟦{証拠|しょうこ}→証拠：10575_shouko⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{示|しめ}す: to present evidence\n\nCOMPOUNDS:\n- ⟦{指示|しじ}→指示：09674_shiji⟧: instruction, direction\n- ⟦{表示|ひょうじ}→表示：03143_hyouji⟧: display, indication\n- ⟦{提示|ていじ}→提示：12905_teiji⟧: presentation\n- ⟦{暗示|あんじ}→暗示：07711_anji⟧: hint, suggestion\n\nUSAGE:\n{示|しめ}す often implies making something visible or clear to others, whether physical (pointing) or abstract (demonstrating a concept).",
